      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجبنهُ</span></b>  <i>He found him to be such as is termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَبَان</span>; (S, Msb, K;) i. e. <i>a coward,</i> or <i>cowardly,</i>
(K,) or <i>weak-hearted:</i> (Msb:) or <i>he reckoned
him a coward;</i> (M, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجتبنهُ</span></b> . (K.)

